nodes.statement:
If all of the following hold:
  (a) both "unit0" is reviewed and "unit0" is staged;
  (b) "unit0" is registered, then "unit1" is classified as "sound_signal_audible".

If all of the following hold:
  (a) both "unit0" is sized and "unit0" is classified as "wrapped_up";
  (b) "unit0" is released, then "unit1" is classified as "sound_casing_intact".

